WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.679
On a quiet winter night,
when the whole town was asleep,

2
00:00:04.729 --> 00:00:07.395
a little letter flew out of one window…

3
00:00:07.445 --> 00:00:09.564
It flew through the snowstorm

4
00:00:09.614 --> 00:00:14.764
— all the way to the place beyond the clouds
where someone was already waiting for it.

5
00:00:19.925 --> 00:00:21.715
Good evening, my friend!

6
00:00:21.765 --> 00:00:23.825
I am Saint Nicholas.

7
00:00:23.875 --> 00:00:29.513
Every year, on this magical night,
thousands of children's letters fly to me.

8
00:00:29.563 --> 00:00:32.462
And look… yours has arrived too.

9
00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:39.714
Andy…

10
00:00:39.764 --> 00:00:41.866
You're already six years old.

11
00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:44.488
And I know that this
year you learned to read

12
00:00:44.538 --> 00:00:47.823
— and you read your very
first book all by yourself!

13
00:00:47.873 --> 00:00:50.091
I am so proud of you.

14
00:00:52.508 --> 00:00:53.344
Look…

15
00:00:53.394 --> 00:00:55.978
I often watch you through
this little window.

16
00:00:56.028 --> 00:01:00.857
I see you playing football —
with so much heart, with so much joy!

17
00:01:00.907 --> 00:01:02.241
Keep it up!

18
00:01:08.492 --> 00:01:13.844
And so today I'm writing your name in
golden letters in the Book of Good Deeds.

19
00:01:13.894 --> 00:01:16.651
And I wish that all your dreams come true,

20
00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:20.209
and that the people who love
you are always by your side.

21
00:01:22.742 --> 00:01:26.138
Do you know what the greatest
wonder in the world is?

22
00:01:26.188 --> 00:01:27.860
A kind heart.

23
00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:31.285
So take good care of it:
listen to Mom and Dad,

24
00:01:31.335 --> 00:01:35.157
help those who are having a
hard time, and share your smile.

25
00:01:35.207 --> 00:01:39.423
And your dreams…
your dreams will surely come true.

26
00:01:40.142 --> 00:01:42.460
And now — a little secret…

27
00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:45.157
My present is already waiting for you.

28
00:01:45.207 --> 00:01:46.985
Take a peek under your pillow…

29
00:01:47.035 --> 00:01:49.717
But don't tell anyone — shhh!

30
00:01:50.807 --> 00:01:54.624
It's time for me to go —
other children are waiting for me.

31
00:01:54.674 --> 00:01:59.825
But remember: every time you do
something kind, I'm right there with you.

32
00:01:59.875 --> 00:02:02.484
Happy Saint Nicholas Day, my friend!

